# Ghostly Keybearer unlocking a door of a Room whose doors are both locked (CR 709.5f: the controller chooses a locked half). Bot1's Unholy Annex (cast
# on turn 1) is exiled by Flickerwisp on turn 3 and returns at the end step not cast, so it has neither door unlocked (CR 709.5d). On turn 5 the Keybearer
# hits Bot2 and Bot1 targets the Room and is asked which door (both halves are offered; Bot1 names Unholy Annex): the left door is unlocked and Ritual Chamber stays
# locked, so no Demon is made (CR 709.5c), and Unholy Annex's end step ability is back: with no Demon Bot1 draws and loses 2 life at its end step (16 after the 2 it lost at its turn 1 end step, none on turn 3 with the Room exiled).
